----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE — what shipped (parity with the web source)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  The web `WidgetComparisonCard` is a PURE presentational widget primitive (a shared widget building block):
  it takes `metrics: ComparisonMetric[]` + optional `compact` and renders a hairline-separated column of
  rows, each = a muted truncated label over a semibold formatted value (+ optional muted unit affix) on the
  left and a direction-aware `<Delta>` (percent change vs the previous period) on the right. Its only own
  branch is `visible.length === 0 -> <p>No comparison data</p>`; `compact` slices to the first two metrics.
  There is NO fetch / React-Query / Promise in the source, so it has NO loading/error/stale/offline branch
  (the host widget that owns the query renders those). Per the sibling presentational-primitive precedent
  (Delta 0081, MetricCard 0095, Accordion 0203) this surface reproduces ONLY the source's REAL branches:
    • populated column  (one row per visible metric, separators except the last; web border-b/last:border-b-0)
    • compact slice     (first two metrics; web metrics.slice(0,2))
    • empty leaf        (friendly "never a blank box" peer of web <p>No comparison data</p>)
  The per-row change indicator REUSES the shared native Delta surface (0081) — the faithful peer of the web
  `<Delta metric={{direction}} display="percent" size="sm" />` (direction = higherIsBetter ?? true).
  Files: WidgetComparisonCard.Adapter/Model/.swift/Views/Previews/Tests/AdapterTests.swift + .strings.
  Bindings : P1/S8 WidgetComparisonCardModel @Observable holder (props + projection; no HTTP in the view);
             P1/S9 tokens (Color.TS/Font.TS/TSSpacing/TSRadius) — no Tailwind ports, no raw hex;
             P1/S10 NSLocalizedString facade (table "WidgetComparisonCard"); P1/S11 view.opened telemetry
             (slug "WidgetComparisonCard", emitted once + idempotent across appear/disappear).
  i18n     : web source has 0 t() keys (anonymous; its only literal "No comparison data" is reproduced via
             widgetComparisonCard.empty). Native a11y/HIG additions: emptyHint, rowLabel, valueUnit. 0 dead.
  a11y     : each row folds label+value into one VoiceOver element ("{label}, {value}{unit}"); Delta keeps
             its own "{current} vs {previous}" reading; empty leaf is one combined element; Dynamic Type via
             tokens; decorative icon/arrow hidden from VoiceOver.

